# The app started again: the draft is still there; emptied, it is gone.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
field 还没发出去的草稿 {T}
shot 1-after-restart
tap 发消息
clear
empty
shot 2-emptied
# (the core keeps the emptied draft on the device behind the app's draft.put: not to be cut off by the app ending)
wait 1500
